{"summary":"犬尿泥是狗尿与泥土的混合物，外用涂敷孕妇腹部，可治疗妊娠期伤寒，防止流产，药泥干后即需更换。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"出自《本草纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"妊娠伤寒，令子不落，涂腹上，干即易（时珍）。","translation":"治疗妊娠期间的伤寒，能防止流产，涂在腹部，干了就更换。（李时珍）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E5%9C%9F%E9%83%A8#犬尿泥","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:20.994Z"}